WEBVTT

00:00:04.280 --> 00:00:07.330
Chihaya-chan, pass me that cookie!

00:00:07.330 --> 00:00:10.190
Haruka, where are your manners...

00:00:12.130 --> 00:00:13.250
That's right...

00:00:13.250 --> 00:00:16.910
We're here at "Vacation Island"!

00:00:16.910 --> 00:00:19.700
This place is near my hometown!

00:00:19.700 --> 00:00:21.320
Wow...

00:00:21.320 --> 00:00:23.880
I wanna go to a resort, too...

00:00:23.880 --> 00:00:26.640
The tea's ready, everyone.

00:00:26.640 --> 00:00:28.440
Hurray!

00:00:31.950 --> 00:00:33.270
I'm back!

00:00:33.270 --> 00:00:35.090
Welcome back!

00:00:35.090 --> 00:00:38.180
Ahh, everyone's here today...

00:00:38.180 --> 00:00:39.860
Perfect!

00:00:39.860 --> 00:00:42.820
Oh! Is it settled, then?

00:00:43.150 --> 00:00:44.290
Yeah!

00:00:44.810 --> 00:00:46.850
Vacation Island

00:00:46.850 --> 00:00:48.820
Global Music Festival?

00:00:49.170 --> 00:00:51.320
Huh? This island is...

00:00:51.320 --> 00:00:53.840
It's the place we just saw on TV!

00:00:53.840 --> 00:01:00.860
The island is full of attractions, including an outdoor stage, a pool, a theme park...

00:01:00.860 --> 00:01:02.300
Ehh...

00:01:02.300 --> 00:01:03.910
It sounds wonderful!

00:01:03.910 --> 00:01:07.720
Ami and Mami wanna live out the rest of our days there!

00:01:07.720 --> 00:01:09.170
Mmhmm!

00:01:09.170 --> 00:01:12.050
But, why are you showing us this?

00:01:12.050 --> 00:01:13.310
Ahem...

00:01:15.280 --> 00:01:20.820
Actually, 765 Pro have been officially invited to this music festival!

00:01:22.250 --> 00:01:25.060
Along with a 3-day, 2-night luxury trip!

00:01:25.410 --> 00:01:25.830
But...

00:01:25.830 --> 00:01:27.880
Alright!!

00:01:27.880 --> 00:01:29.870
A resort, I can't believe it!

00:01:29.870 --> 00:01:34.310
We'll be standing alongside singers from around the world, what an honor!

00:01:34.310 --> 00:01:36.990
Hey, Miki! Wake up, this is big news!

00:01:36.990 --> 00:01:39.380
Let me sleep a bit more...

00:01:39.380 --> 00:01:42.570
So when are we leaving?

00:01:41.660 --> 00:01:42.560
W-Wait...

00:01:43.600 --> 00:01:45.630
STOP!!

00:01:46.180 --> 00:01:47.890
Well, what I was about to say is...

00:01:49.900 --> 00:01:52.980
Not everyone is going to be able to go.

00:01:56.240 --> 00:02:01.400
So, the members who will be going are...

00:02:01.600 --> 00:02:06.740
Ahh, I'm so nervous. I can't believe I was picked...

00:02:07.320 --> 00:02:09.300
You'll be fine!

00:02:09.300 --> 00:02:11.080
She's right, Yukiho...

00:02:11.080 --> 00:02:14.240
You will not be able to fulfill your potential like this.

00:02:14.250 --> 00:02:17.000
Hm... Miki...?

00:02:17.000 --> 00:02:20.820
What's wrong, gazing off like that? Are you still sleepy?

00:02:20.830 --> 00:02:26.030
Uh-uh! Actually, I'm worried if I'll even be able to sleep tonight!

00:02:26.390 --> 00:02:29.920
I mean, it's a 3-day, 2-night holiday, right!?

00:02:31.910 --> 00:02:35.650
And, and...! A vacation together with my honey...

00:02:36.760 --> 00:02:39.010
Watching the sunset with my honey...

00:02:39.630 --> 00:02:41.770
Having dinner with my honey...

00:02:42.160 --> 00:02:45.420
And at night, under the starry sky...

00:02:46.090 --> 00:02:51.110
Miki, we are there to work, so I think that is unlikely.

00:02:51.110 --> 00:02:55.600
Muu! Don't bring me back to reality so suddenly...

00:02:57.020 --> 00:03:00.820
You really are like a lady in love, Miki-chan!

00:03:01.930 --> 00:03:08.590
If I don't understand that feeling, I wonder
if I can really do this show properly...

00:03:08.600 --> 00:03:18.320
Yeah, the song we'll be performing, "edeN", is a
 love song... but I've never been in love either...

00:03:18.490 --> 00:03:20.710
What about you, Takane?

00:03:20.720 --> 00:03:24.960
No... I too have not yet had such an experience...

00:03:25.340 --> 00:03:31.690
I see... I've had singing and dance lessons, but...

00:03:27.260 --> 00:03:31.690
A love song... a date with my honey...

00:03:31.700 --> 00:03:32.880
Ahhh!!

00:03:34.170 --> 00:03:36.100
M-Miki-chan... what's wrong...?

00:03:37.950 --> 00:03:41.470
Alright, leave the show and the love to Miki!

00:03:49.550 --> 00:03:51.860
T-this is...!

00:03:51.860 --> 00:03:54.100
Vacation Island!!

00:03:54.440 --> 00:03:57.300
Alright everyone, about today's schedule...

00:03:57.300 --> 00:03:58.840
Hey, honey!

00:03:58.840 --> 00:04:02.460
Leave today's rehearsal to Miki and the others!

00:04:03.210 --> 00:04:05.640
Huh... what sort of rehearsal are you planning?

00:04:05.660 --> 00:04:09.460
Well... Love Lesson 101!

00:04:09.770 --> 00:04:12.220
Love... lesson...?

00:04:14.010 --> 00:04:17.940
Umm, are you being serious?

00:04:17.940 --> 00:04:24.700
Yes. We have all received training in
things such as singing and choreography...

00:04:24.700 --> 00:04:30.800
But, umm... we haven't yet
properly been in love or anything, so...

00:04:30.800 --> 00:04:33.300
Miki-chan said that while we're on the island,

00:04:33.300 --> 00:04:37.200
w-we should act like we're in love with you, Producer,

00:04:37.200 --> 00:04:40.800
so that we understand the
emotion behind love songs...

00:04:42.420 --> 00:04:46.230
In love with me... what on earth are you gonna do?

00:04:46.230 --> 00:04:49.650
Miki's already thought of all that!

00:04:49.650 --> 00:04:54.240
You come to the places written on this
sheet at each of these times, Producer!

00:04:55.160 --> 00:04:58.320
H-hey, Miki, come on, explain properly!!

00:04:58.320 --> 00:05:01.530
Why are you leaving me here, anyway!?

00:05:01.530 --> 00:05:05.410
Waiting to meet up beforehand
is what makes dates exciting!

00:05:05.410 --> 00:05:06.850
D-dates!?

00:05:07.500 --> 00:05:09.280
Alright, see you later!

00:05:09.280 --> 00:05:11.860
H-heyy!?

00:05:14.560 --> 00:05:19.470
1:00 - in front of the theme park...
3:00 - forest cafe...

00:05:19.470 --> 00:05:22.100
5:00 - observation deck...
7:00 - pool...

00:05:22.600 --> 00:05:25.340
What kind of lessons are these...?

00:05:25.350 --> 00:05:29.890
They might be on to something, though...

00:05:29.890 --> 00:05:31.320
Producer?

00:05:34.290 --> 00:05:36.650
U-umm, sorry about today...

00:05:37.440 --> 00:05:46.390
But, I thought maybe it would be good if I
understood those sort of feelings a bit... no?

00:05:48.190 --> 00:05:52.990
You all decided this together,
for the sake of the show, right?

00:05:53.000 --> 00:05:56.410
Oh, yes...

00:05:56.410 --> 00:05:59.670
OK, let's give it a go!

00:06:00.220 --> 00:06:06.420
I'm probably a bit lacking,
but if it might help with the show, then...

00:06:06.840 --> 00:06:08.580
O-OK!

00:06:09.270 --> 00:06:11.540
Things are looking pretty good!

00:06:11.540 --> 00:06:15.660
Yeah, it looks like this plan will go well!

00:06:16.890 --> 00:06:20.840
Hmm? This feels a bit strange, though...

00:06:23.120 --> 00:06:28.900
Alright, next is the forest cafe... I wonder who's next...?

00:06:30.890 --> 00:06:35.620
You're right on time, Producer!

00:06:35.620 --> 00:06:37.860
Makoto, your outfit...

00:06:38.360 --> 00:06:44.330
Ehehe! Well, today is supposed to be
practice for our perfect date,

00:06:44.330 --> 00:06:47.460
so I'm wearing a dress, like I've always wanted...

00:06:47.460 --> 00:06:49.400
It doesn't look weird, does it...?

00:06:49.980 --> 00:06:51.770
No, it suits you.

00:06:53.780 --> 00:06:56.080
...Heheh, alright!

00:06:56.080 --> 00:06:59.450
Come on... you're wearing a dress, act the part!

00:06:59.970 --> 00:07:01.470
This is going well, too...

00:07:01.940 --> 00:07:03.670
You're right.

00:07:03.680 --> 00:07:07.610
I wonder if my honey's actually a playboy...

00:07:08.750 --> 00:07:12.710
Umm, well we asked him to do this,
so it can't really be helped, I suppose...

00:07:14.080 --> 00:07:15.980
Well yeah, but...

00:07:21.030 --> 00:07:23.170
Next is the observation deck...

00:07:23.820 --> 00:07:30.170
This isn't fair, one of me and four of them...

00:07:30.880 --> 00:07:33.400
I've been waiting for you, my dear.

00:07:33.870 --> 00:07:35.530
M-my dear!?

00:07:36.850 --> 00:07:38.660
Should I not call you that...?

00:07:38.660 --> 00:07:41.530
N-no, it's not that, but...

00:07:42.100 --> 00:07:47.390
I know nothing at all of these
"dates" of which Miki speaks...

00:07:47.390 --> 00:07:52.820
So, I thought perhaps we could
gaze at the sunset together...

00:07:52.830 --> 00:07:55.020
Y-yeah...

00:07:56.820 --> 00:08:02.980
Beautiful... t-the sunset, I mean!!

00:08:02.980 --> 00:08:05.920
I understood. Heheh...

00:08:06.400 --> 00:08:11.400
Hmm... they look like a pretty good couple...

00:08:11.410 --> 00:08:15.480
Huh? What's wrong, Miki?

00:08:15.490 --> 00:08:21.950
Hm? No, nothing... nothing...

00:08:27.420 --> 00:08:30.730
Phew... only Miki left to go...

00:08:31.210 --> 00:08:34.200
Alright, please contact the performers.

00:08:34.200 --> 00:08:35.070
Yes, sir!

00:08:35.580 --> 00:08:37.700
That's the festival's...

00:08:38.660 --> 00:08:42.280
Excuse me! You're from the festival committee, right?

00:08:42.280 --> 00:08:45.500
I'm from 765 Pro...

00:08:53.840 --> 00:08:57.650
Argh, I only meant to say hello, and...!

00:08:58.680 --> 00:08:59.760
Miki!

00:09:04.080 --> 00:09:12.240
Sorry, Miki. I was just greeting someone from the
festival committee in the lobby, and I got held up...

00:09:12.260 --> 00:09:13.420
Miki...

00:09:15.780 --> 00:09:21.250
Do you know how Miki felt,
waiting here alone, honey...?

00:09:21.560 --> 00:09:22.960
Huh...?

00:09:23.560 --> 00:09:26.820
You weren't late meeting anyone else,

00:09:26.820 --> 00:09:28.820
Only Miki...

00:09:29.170 --> 00:09:32.340
You're right... sorry.

00:09:32.340 --> 00:09:36.660
I know it's a bit of an unusual lesson, but work is work, right...

00:09:36.660 --> 00:09:40.470
Sorry I couldn't be on time.

00:09:40.740 --> 00:09:43.370
Come on, Miki, it's not too late to...

00:09:43.370 --> 00:09:44.790
Forget it!

00:09:45.840 --> 00:09:46.980
Miki...

00:09:50.390 --> 00:09:52.260
Miki-chan...

00:09:55.180 --> 00:09:57.510
I'll leave this here, Miki-chan...

00:10:00.050 --> 00:10:04.070
Hey, come on, Miki, perk up.

00:10:04.080 --> 00:10:07.600
It's not like the Producer was trying to be mean...

00:10:07.600 --> 00:10:12.530
You and the others all got to go on your dates,
Makoto-kun, that's why you can say that...

00:10:15.300 --> 00:10:19.600
If you don't eat anything, it'll affect tomorrow's practice.

00:10:19.600 --> 00:10:22.330
We are here for work, after all...

00:10:22.330 --> 00:10:25.040
Ah, I'll make some nice, warm tea...

00:10:25.360 --> 00:10:26.270
Just leave me alone!

00:10:27.560 --> 00:10:30.910
Miki's fine, so just leave her alone!

00:10:33.580 --> 00:10:35.920
Sorry, Miki-chan...

00:10:46.020 --> 00:10:53.200
Stupid honey... but it's Miki who's really stupid...

00:10:55.070 --> 00:10:57.960
Miki seemed really sad, didn't she...

00:10:59.760 --> 00:11:03.130
Yeah... but we are here for work...

00:11:03.130 --> 00:11:06.130
She needs to perk up soon...

00:11:06.800 --> 00:11:08.840
Yeah...

00:11:11.500 --> 00:11:15.630
I feel sort of envious, though...

00:11:15.630 --> 00:11:16.800
Huh?

00:11:16.800 --> 00:11:18.360
What's wrong?

00:11:18.360 --> 00:11:21.940
Mm... uh-uh...

00:11:23.620 --> 00:11:31.910
I thought that love was a feeling
akin to yearning for the moon...

00:11:31.920 --> 00:11:38.610
But perhaps, love is in fact
something much closer by.

00:11:58.250 --> 00:12:01.970
Wait at the theme park at exactly 10:00...

00:12:03.390 --> 00:12:06.710
I wonder if Miki's gonna get told off...

00:12:11.810 --> 00:12:13.360
No one's here...

00:12:14.560 --> 00:12:18.450
It was Miki's fault, anyway, though...

00:12:19.060 --> 00:12:19.720
Miki-chan...

00:12:20.220 --> 00:12:23.270
Oh... Yukiho, Takane...

00:12:25.340 --> 00:12:26.560
Umm...

00:12:26.880 --> 00:12:29.190
I'm sorry about yesterday!

00:12:31.140 --> 00:12:36.860
We said all that stuff without thinking
about your feelings, Miki-chan...

00:12:36.860 --> 00:12:40.420
But... that was Miki's...

00:12:41.460 --> 00:12:50.860
Say, Miki-chan, after that, we were thinking about how we could cheer you up...

00:12:51.360 --> 00:12:53.120
And, umm...

00:12:55.120 --> 00:12:59.530
Miki! Please come on a date with me today!

00:12:59.530 --> 00:13:00.680
Makoto-kun!?

00:13:00.690 --> 00:13:06.770
Ehehe, it probably would have been
better if we'd had the Producer come...

00:13:07.160 --> 00:13:13.770
We intended to consult him this morning,
but he appeared to have already gone out.

00:13:14.320 --> 00:13:18.000
So we thought about what we could do alone...

00:13:19.670 --> 00:13:23.460
Miki...? Am I no good, after all...?

00:13:26.680 --> 00:13:28.490
M-Miki-chan?

00:13:28.500 --> 00:13:31.560
Ehehe, I love you all!!

00:13:35.500 --> 00:13:38.800
Looks like I'm not needed here...

00:13:39.440 --> 00:13:41.000
P-Producer!?

00:13:41.010 --> 00:13:42.530
Why are you dressed like that?

00:13:43.780 --> 00:13:48.810
I thought I'd ask you out on a date today, so I rented it...

00:13:48.820 --> 00:13:52.130
Ahh... I guess it was a waste.

00:13:52.230 --> 00:14:01.960
Uh-uh, that's not true! Let's all go on a
date! I'm sure it'll be really, really fun!

00:14:06.250 --> 00:14:10.820
So, do you think the Love Lessons will
come in handy for the show, everyone?

00:14:10.820 --> 00:14:13.900
Umm, maybe not the lessons themselves...

00:14:13.900 --> 00:14:15.430
Huh!?

00:14:15.430 --> 00:14:22.420
Perhaps we do not yet
know much of love itself...

00:14:22.420 --> 00:14:28.850
However, I have never spent a
night pondering love so earnestly.

00:14:29.840 --> 00:14:36.750
We thought about Miki, and then...
We got to thinking about ourselves...

00:14:37.000 --> 00:14:42.750
And I think that just a little bit...
We're closer to the feeling behind the song.

00:14:44.800 --> 00:14:45.870
I see...

00:14:53.100 --> 00:14:56.630
Alright, everyone, show time! Give it your all!

00:14:56.630 --> 00:14:57.150
OK!

00:14:59.510 --> 00:15:00.880
Hey, honey!

00:15:01.480 --> 00:15:05.390
I'd like a reward if we win!

00:15:05.800 --> 00:15:12.160
OK, leave it to me... wait, what? A reward?

00:15:12.630 --> 00:15:15.860
Well... the reward is...!

00:17:26.960 --> 00:17:32.180
And now, let me announce the winners... The winners are...

00:17:33.160 --> 00:17:36.530
everyone from 765 Pro!

00:17:36.860 --> 00:17:38.800
Wahh, we did it!!

00:17:39.500 --> 00:17:41.180
Thank you!

00:17:43.620 --> 00:17:46.180
Honey!

00:17:46.720 --> 00:17:48.380
Congratulations, everyone!

00:17:49.320 --> 00:17:53.100
Hey, gimme the reward you promised!

00:17:53.100 --> 00:17:58.390
Huh... yeah. W-what!?

00:17:58.390 --> 00:18:03.000
What do you mean "what"... A kiss! My reward kiss!

00:18:03.000 --> 00:18:04.240
Ahh... but, umm...

00:18:04.640 --> 00:18:07.240
A promise is a promise!

00:18:07.240 --> 00:18:09.390
A man's word is his bond.

00:18:09.390 --> 00:18:11.700
I-I'm not looking!

00:18:12.610 --> 00:18:14.630
That's not...

00:18:14.630 --> 00:18:16.970
Ugh, how disgusting!

00:18:17.820 --> 00:18:19.210
Huh? E-everyone!!

00:18:19.560 --> 00:18:22.510
We came all the way here to support you, and now...

00:18:22.510 --> 00:18:24.510
You perv, Producer!

00:18:24.510 --> 00:18:27.480
You're a sly one, Nii-chan!

00:18:27.480 --> 00:18:30.230
You've... you've got it all wrong!!

00:18:37.110 --> 00:18:40.020
I was so surprised, though!

00:18:40.020 --> 00:18:44.970
Hehe, everyone wanted to come and
support the others, so here we are!

00:18:44.970 --> 00:18:50.140
Hoho... if there's a party going on,
I thought that everyone should be here!

00:18:50.140 --> 00:18:53.610
Thank you, President, Otonashi-san...

00:18:53.610 --> 00:18:55.480
Thank you for waiting!

00:18:55.870 --> 00:18:59.570
Now, let's ask everyone at 765 Pro for an encore!

00:19:00.210 --> 00:19:01.900
Encore!

00:19:01.900 --> 00:19:04.930
Encore! Encore!

00:19:05.890 --> 00:19:08.620
Alright, get ready to go on stage, quickly...

00:19:08.620 --> 00:19:10.860
Umm, Producer...

00:19:11.390 --> 00:19:14.930
We all thought about it, and...

00:19:15.200 --> 00:19:18.100
We'd all like to sing together at the end!

00:19:19.150 --> 00:19:22.180
I see... what a good idea!

00:19:22.180 --> 00:19:25.230
Nihihi... you're coming on too, you know!

00:19:25.420 --> 00:19:28.120
Piyo-chan, too!!

00:19:28.620 --> 00:19:30.580
And you, President!

00:19:30.580 --> 00:19:31.630
Me too?

00:19:32.020 --> 00:19:35.350
Uu-uuu! Let's all sing together!

00:19:35.360 --> 00:19:37.510
Come on, Producer-san!

00:19:46.890 --> 00:19:52.910
OK, let's go! To our world of music!
